    "scenesThatPass": [
      "ALICE: I was on a date. They’ll think I had something to do with it.\nSTELLA: It wasn’t us. It was the book. And it’s all over.",
      "ALICE: Then why is she torturing us? What did we ever do to her--\nSTELLA: We have her book. And she’s still writing stories. Why?",
      "LIBRARIAN ASSISTANT: Afternoon, may I help you - Oh honey, you need to get that cherry checked out.\nALICE: It’s stress. Where’s your nearest washroom?\nLIBRARIAN ASSISTANT: Here, let me show you.",
      "STELLA: CALL AN AMBULANCE!!!\nALICE: ... They’re all over me. Get them off. Get them off...",
      "STELLA: “... Her family locked her away in Riverwell, where they made her forget the truth, so that she would believe her family’s lies...”\nSTELLA: “And when she tried to fix what was broken, they murdered her -- with their bare hands... Sarah hated her family for their betrayal... So sh…\nSTELLA: No, no, no. Come on. Please --\nDINAH MICHAELS: Don’t you want to know how the story ends?... I’ll help you."
    ]
  },
